<title>USA: AAR sells hardware distribution unit.</title>
<headline>AAR sells hardware distribution unit.</headline>
<dateline>WOOD DALE, Ill. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>AAR Corp said Thursday it sold its Cerritos, Calif.-based hardware distribution business last week to a private company.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed, but a company spokeswoman said its impact would be neutral to AAR's financial results.</p>
<p>The divested business, which distributed seals and fasteners, was not meeting AAR's performance objectives, the company said.</p>
<p>AAR supplies products and services for the global aviation industry.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
